title: Security Department
new-page: true
is-card: true
on-arrival: month_actions += 1
card-image: img/SD.jpeg
frequency: 100
tags: inter_affairs
go-to: SD

= Security Department

@SD

For better or worse, the SCP Foundation cannot exist without the Security Department, the Security Department is the one that puts foundation in the SCP Foundation.
Secure. Contain. Protect.

- @actions: Order the Security Department.
- @operations: Conduct operations.
- @recruit: Recruit more security personnels.
- @loyalty: Improve the loyaly of security personnels.
- @root: We either don't want or cannot do anything regarding the security department at the moment.
- @easy_discard

@actions
subtitle: W.I.P

The Security Department awaits your commands.

- @strict: Enforce stricter rules to keep Class-D personnels in check.
- @back: Return

@strict
choose-if: class_d_riot <= 0.6
unavailable-subtitle: There is currently an ongoing riot.
on-arrival:

@operations

Here are the list of operations that we can entrust our security guards with.

- @investigate: Investigate and handle anyone suspected of trying to instigate a riot.
- @curb: Handle the mob of Class-Ds causing trouble.
- @back: Return

@investigate
subtitle: -1 resources
view-if: class_d_riot >= 0.40 and class_d_riot <= 0.59
choose-if: resources >= 1 and investigation_sd_timer <= 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if resources <= 0 and investigation_sd_timer <= 0: Not enough resources. ?][? if investigation_sd_timer >= 1 : There is currently an ongoing investigation. ?]
on-arrival: resources -= 1; class_d_riot -= 0.08; investigation_sd_timer += 2

We have decided to run a routine check investigate suspicious class-d personnels, class-ds found trying to instigate a riot and those that have connection with the Chaos Insurgents are taken care of.

@curb
subtitle: -2 resources
view-if: class_d_riot >= 0.6
choose-if: resources >= 2
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
on-arrival: resources -= 2; class_d_riot -= 0.15

Blood must be spilled for the sake of peace.

@recruit
go-to: SD

@loyalty
subtitle: -1 resources
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
on-arrival: resources -= 1

@back
go-to: SD
